== Trivia ==
* '''"Hunter" Tobias''' is implied to be a fraud or a "nepo baby", with {{NPCSprite|Helia}}'s [[Chapters]] suggesting that the first person to complete the [[Critterdex]] was a nepo baby.
** This is further implied through the usage of quotes in his name, as well as him denying that his success is correlated to his father's ownership of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

